      <p>Night. The entire residential district of β017 — Dutch terraced houses, canal streets, paper lanterns. Every player receives one lantern. Real flame. Red spider lily design. The only stated rule: <em>"Find the exit. Your lantern will guide you."</em></p>
      <p>The exit is at the geometric centre of the district. The boundary contracts inward one city block every 30 minutes — architecture literally closing, bridges retracting, walls extending into formerly passable spaces. Players caught in the contraction zone are absorbed into the garden.</p>
