      <p>The physiological state required to navigate successfully — calm, low arousal, deliberate movement, suppressed emotional response — is the same state clinically associated with <strong>dissociative numbing</strong> in trauma contexts. The game is asking players to voluntarily induce a mild dissociative state and navigate from inside it.</p>
