    <div class="mystery-closer">
      "Being okay is what kills you. The better you feel about your chances, the brighter you are, the more targeted you are. The exit surge — the moment you see it and think <em>I'm going to make it</em> — is the brightest you will ever be in this game and it happens at the exact second you're closest to winning. The game is punishing you for the feeling of surviving. I have never been so angry at a mechanic in my life. I am so done. I am so done with this."
