    <div class="content-block">
      <div class="block-label">Setup</div>
      <p>An imperial examination hall — Dutch neoclassical exterior, Chinese examination cell interior. 180 individual wooden cells, 1.5 by 1.5 metres, open at the front, arranged in a grid facing a central stage. Every player is seated in a cell when the game begins. On each desk: a sealed document. The rule: <em>"The document contains a life. Find whose life it is among the players present. You have 12 hours. You may not ask anyone directly about their identity."</em></p>
