    <div class="harvest-box">
      <p>The recognition spike — when someone realises they've been found, that another player read their patterns, identified their physical tells, and located the non-strategic true thing about them — is the highest-amplitude individual life-force output in the cycle. The Dragon game is structured so that dozens of these spikes occur near-simultaneously at the 12-hour mark. Lilly designed the diamond round specifically for this harvest. The examination format, the simultaneous reveal, the specific architecture of the non-strategic true detail — all of it exists to produce dozens of recognition moments in the same hour, creating a cumulative harvest that exceeds what any single high-amplitude event could provide.</p>
