      <p>The full preserved city of β017. No boundaries stated. No time limit stated. First daylight since game 4. The gates are open. The rule: <em>"You are free to go."</em></p>
      <p>This is true. The gates at the city's edge are open. Beyond them is the unstructured remainder — the zone between β017's curated section and the liminal space. Players who walk through have three hours before the biological persistence drain reaches threshold. Three hours is enough time to approach the horizon. It is not enough time to reach what lies beyond it. The boundary between β017's dead space and adjacent space is real but crossing it enters the liminal space — a navigation void with no exit logic for anyone without specific anchor points.</p>
