    <div class="content-block">
      <div class="block-label">Setup</div>
      <p>The entire realm. No boundaries. No time limit. Each surviving player receives one item — different for every player, selected by Tiger Lily's observation system from eleven games of data. The item is always an object from their base life: a tool, an instrument, something their hands knew intimately before the wipe. They don't know why they're holding it. Their hands do. The rule: <em>"There is one opponent. Survive her."</em></p>
