      <p>What's left is the corpse of β017 with a fully powered Red Spider Lilly where the Warden used to be. And a group of survivors who just watched the entity that designed their games — reduced though she was — get absorbed by the entity that corrupted her.</p>
      <p>That is when Tulip presses the beacon.</p>
